<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-420271-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-420271-1')">1</a>. I'm sure someone could come up with a way to &quot;contain&quot; Jesse, but to do that you're ignoring the fact that getting out of weird shitty situations by being awesome is a <em>core character feature.</em> It's the kind of fight where you have to decide which universe's core narrative you're going to disrespect, and &quot;Jesse gets out&quot; is just a better story than &quot;Agent Bob and Researcher Tim put Jesse in a box forever, the end.&quot;</div>
